      "content": "i don't really want to make a fuss or go to the doctor for something small if i don't have to. it only lasted a second and i feel fine now. you think its just the heat/dehydration then? i'll just grab a big bottle of water and a Gatorade and lie down for a bit, that'll fix it right?",
