      "content": "While taking extra salt and staying hydrated with Gatorade can help alleviate symptoms, it's not likely to completely eliminate the need for a doctor's visit. A dizzy spell can be a symptom of an underlying condition that isn't just a matter of dehydration, such as orthostatic hypotension, anemia, or even neurological issues. If you continue to experience dizziness spells, especially if they recur or worsen, it's still best to consult with your doctor to rule out any underlying conditions that require medical attention.",
